id: 40
hanzi: 当地
pinyin: dāng dì
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Noun

meanings_summary:
  en: local; in the locality; indigenous; on site
  es: local; del lugar; autóctono; en la localidad; in situ

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Noun | Standard | the specific geographical place, locality, or region where an event occurs or where a person resides | el lugar o localidad precisa donde sucede un acontecimiento o reside una comunidad | 当地政府 (local government)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 微信在海外推广时，通过签约广受当地民众喜爱的本土体育明星，迅速拉近了与消费者的情感距离。 | Wēixìn zài hǎiwài tuīguǎng shí, tōngguò qiānyuē guǎngshòu dāngdì mínzhòng xǐ'ài de běntǔ tǐyù míngxīng, xùnsù lājìnle yǔ xiāofèizhě de qínggǎn jùlí. | When promoting overseas, WeChat quickly bridged emotional distance with consumers by signing local sports stars widely beloved by local residents. | Al promocionarse en el exterior, WeChat acortó distancias fichando a figuras del deporte autóctonas muy queridas por el público local.
  #2 | 旅行者每到一个全新的国度，都应当主动尊重当地的风俗习惯与宗教信仰，以包容的心态体验异域文化。 | Lǚxíngzhě měi dào yī gè quánxīn de guódù, dōu yīngdāng zhǔdòng zūnzhòng dāngdì de fēngsú xíguàn yǔ zōngjiào xìnyǎng, yǐ bāoróng de xīntài tǐyàn yìyù wénhuà. | Whenever arriving in a brand-new country, travelers should proactively respect local customs and religious beliefs, experiencing foreign cultures with tolerance. | Al llegar a un nuevo país, el viajero debe respetar los usos y credos locales con espíritu tolerante para empaparse de la cultura autóctona.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  当地政府 | local government
  当地居民 | local residents
  当地文化 | local culture
  融入当地 | integrate into the local community
  当地特色 | local characteristics / specialties
  当地时间 | local time

idioms[4]{hanzi,pinyin,meaning_en}:
  入乡随俗 | rù xiāng suí sú | when entering a village, follow its customs; do as the Romans do
  因地制宜 | yīn dì zhì yí | adapt measures to local conditions; take suited actions
  土生土长 | tǔ shēng tǔ zhǎng | born and bred locally; native born
  安土重迁 | ān tǔ zhòng qiān | attached to one's native soil and reluctant to move away

character_decomposition[2]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  当 | dāng | ought; equal; match; just at (time/place); serve as | deber; corresponder; justo en; ejercer de; en el acto | ⺌ | small / top dots | 尚 (lofty banner / value) + 田 (field / land of value) | Historical phonetic nuance in 當 | 6 | 上下结构 | Value of land 田 matched equally against price 尚; indicates being right on site, corresponding directly to the present time or place. | Marking an exact value directly on the designated plot of land (当). | Fijar un justo valor sobre la parcela concreta señalando el lugar presente (当). | 55 | FS | 當
  地 | dì | earth; ground; place; region; locality | tierra; suelo; paraje; comarca; localidad | 土 | earth | 土 (soil mounds) + 也 (yielding expanse of terrain) | 也 (yě / phonetic nuance dì) | 6 | 左右结构 | Mounds of earth 土 spreading across receptive expanses 也; indicates place, location, region, and ground. | Mounds of fertile soil (土) defining a distinct regional place (地). | La tierra fértil (土) que delimita una comarca o lugar geográfico (地). | 51 | GPD | ""

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: Right at the designated present spot (当) upon that specific plot of earth (地) is the local scene (当地).
  composite_memory_hook_es: Estar en el acto (当) sobre el propio suelo o paraje (地) es ser del lugar o local (当地).
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: Classical administrative terminology (当时、当地): anchoring judicial rulings and tax levies to the concrete historical time and geographic locality.
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: First tone followed by fourth tone: 'dāng dì' (55-51). Hold high pitch 55, then execute a sharp decisive fall to 51.

traps_and_cognates:
  look_alikes[4]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,distinction_note}:
    党 | dǎng | political party | Has 儿 at bottom instead of 彐 in 当
    常 | cháng | frequent; common | Has towel 巾 at bottom
    池 | chí | pond; pool | Has water radical 氵 on left of 也 instead of earth 土 in 地
    场 | chǎng | field; open ground | Has 𠃓 on right of 土 instead of 也
  etymological_cognates[4]{character,pinyin,gloss_en}:
